# Kandidat F: google/embeddinggemma-2 (744M, Apache-2.0), embeddingmodell for sokning
# i kod och text. 768 dimensioner (Matryoshka 512/256/128), 8192 tokens, 100+ sprak.
# Kraver vLLM nyare an 0.31.0 (stodet gick in 2026-10-06): bild
# vllm/vllm-openai:cu134-nightly-81198e97ba7eee2a22540caaa756b7fdddcb4d93 (arm64, 2026-10-08).
# Kors som sidomodell (llm@embed, port 8002) bredvid kodmodellen: ca 0,5 GiB minne.
# Klienten satter prefix sjalv: "task: code retrieval | query: ..." for fragor,
# "title: none | text: ..." for dokument. Otestat.
--runner pooling
# Standardvalet (Triton-attention) kraver 160 kB delat minne per block; GB10 har 99 kB
# ("triton OutOfResources: shared memory, Required 163840, Hardware limit 101376").
# FlashInfer fungerar pa GB10 (samma som receptet for C).
--attention-backend flashinfer
--max-model-len 8192
--limit-mm-per-prompt {"image":0,"audio":0,"video":0}
--gpu-memory-utilization 0.05
--max-num-seqs 32
